  "instructions": [
    "Heat one tablespoon of oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and sauté until translucent, about five minutes.",
    "Stir in the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for one minute until fragrant.",
    "Pour in the vegetable broth and bring to a gentle boil.",
    "Add the sliced water chestnuts, lemon zest, chili flakes, and smoked paprika, then reduce heat and simmer for fifteen minutes.",
    "Season the soup with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Remove from heat and allow to cool slightly before blending until smooth, leaving some whole chestnut pieces for texture.",
    "Reheat the soup gently, garnish with chopped parsley, and serve hot."
  ],
